{"id":"e29684b5da80cff5","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-fun-pointwise-order.md","title":"ZFC Fun Pointwise Order","display":"df-zfc-fun-pointwise-order — ZFC Fun Pointwise Order","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-fun-pointwise-order","aliases":["58-df-zfc-fun-pointwise-order"],"display":"df-zfc-fun-pointwise-order — ZFC Fun Pointwise Order","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-order]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-fun-pointwise-order"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-fun-pointwise-order</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-fun-pointwise-order — ZFC Fun Pointwise Order"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\">\\(f,g\\)</span> (functions, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (common domain)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> (common ordered codomain)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\">\\(\\leq\\)</span> (order relation on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (three-place function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Order}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Order}_S\\)</span> (order predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2aa29158e60b337f\" href=\"?note=2aa29158e60b337f\" title=\"58-df-order\">58-df-order</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFunPointwiseOrder}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFunPointwiseOrder}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFunPointwiseOrder}_S(f,g,X,Y,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Order}_S(Y,\\leq)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(f(x)\\leq g(x))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}order} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFunPointwiseOrder}_S(f,g,X,Y,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(g,X,Y)\\land\\mathrm{Order}_S(Y,\\leq)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(f(x)\\leq g(x))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348